rospective analysis, transaction<br>recommendation / approval management, etc<br><br>Analyze data<br>extensively and communicate findings to senior management<br><br>Requirements<br><br>REQUIRED QUALIFICATIONS AND EXPERIENCE<br><br>Graduate /<br>Post -graduate with 2 -7 years of experience in Data science and analytics.<br><br>Experience in<br>handling large volumes of data and generating meaningful insights and actionable<br><br>Experience in<br>analytics projects in banking / NBFC domain would be preferred<br><br>Hands -on expertise in<br>SQL is a must<br><br>Exposure of<br>developing analytical reports on Tableau/Power BI is preferred .</span></div><div jsname="G7vtgf" class="TOQyFc Uzkg7d MmMIvd brKmxb" aria-controls="tsuid_2tL6at-hKI3BjuMPgsuI8QY_240" role="button" tabindex="0" jsaction="EMtXr" data-l="" data-hveid="CCsQPw" data-ved="2ahUKEwjf9oOfnIyYAxWNoGMGHYIlIm4Ql5ACegQIKxA_"><hr class="Bi9oQd" aria-hidden="true"><div class="Wjtive btku5b rXoM2c sjVJQd"><div class="niO4u VDgVie SlP8xc"><span class="cHaqb"><span class="PBBEhf">Show full description</span></span><span class="T2xY9b w2fKdd z1asCe" aria-hidden="true" style="height:18px;line-height:18px;width:18px"><svg focusable="false" aria-hidden="true" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 -960 960 960"><path d="M480-344L240-584l56-56L480-456L664-640l56,56L480-344Z"></path></svg></span></div></div></div></div></div><div class="XFOJCe" data-ved="2ahUKEwjf9oOfnIyYAxWNoGMGHYIlIm4Q5ZkFegQIKxBA"><div class="EyBRub" data-ved="2ahUKEwjf9oOfnIyYAxWNoGMGHYIlIm4Qyo8CegQIKxBB"><div jscontroller="Wo3n8" jsname="aadvhe" jsmodel=" d5EhJe" data-bkt="horizon_jobs" data-fhs="" data-maindata='[null,null,"bind(&#39;java/com/google/gws/plugins/horizon/jobs/viewer/herocontent/jslayout/feedback_messages.html#JobAtEmployer&#39;,{employer_name:&#39;Recognized&#39;,job_title:&#39;Opportunity for Data Analytics ( SQL + Power BI) (Pune)&#39;})","_2tL6at-hKI3BjuMPgsuI8QY_253",null,13,null,null,null,null,null,5025273,"horizon_jo