ills.<br>• Proficiency in Excel, Power BI, PowerPoint, and data<br>visualization tools.<br>• Ability to summarize complex technical information for<br>leadership audiences.<br>• Experience with automotive product development, validation,<br>benchmarking, or vehicle engineering preferred.<br><br>Success Measures<br>• Reduced response time to technical information requests.<br>• Improved visibility of benchmarking and vehicle synthesis<br>activities.<br>• Accurate and timely reporting of VSS plans, metrics, and<br>program status.<br>• Enhanced decision-making through data-driven insights and<br>executive-level reporting.</span></div><div jsname="G7vtgf" class="TOQyFc Uzkg7d MmMIvd brKmxb" aria-controls="tsuid_2tL6at-hKI3BjuMPgsuI8QY_215" role="button" tabindex="0" jsaction="EMtXr" data-l="" data-hveid="CCoQPw" data-ved="2ahUKEwjf9oOfnIyYAxWNoGMGHYIlIm4Ql5ACegQIKhA_"><hr class="Bi9oQd" aria-hidden="true"><div class="Wjtive btku5b rXoM2c sjVJQd"><div class="niO4u VDgVie SlP8xc"><span class="cHaqb"><span class="PBBEhf">Show full description</span></span><span class="T2xY9b w2fKdd z1asCe" aria-hidden="true" style="height:18px;line-height:18px;width:18px"><svg focusable="false" aria-hidden="true" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 -960 960 960"><path d="M480-344L240-584l56-56L480-456L664-640l56,56L480-344Z"></path></svg></span></div></div></div></div></div><div class="XFOJCe" data-ved="2ahUKEwjf9oOfnIyYAxWNoGMGHYIlIm4Q5ZkFegQIKhBA"><div class="EyBRub" data-ved="2ahUKEwjf9oOfnIyYAxWNoGMGHYIlIm4Qyo8CegQIKhBB"><div jscontroller="Wo3n8" jsname="aadvhe" jsmodel=" d5EhJe" data-bkt="horizon_jobs" data-fhs="" data-maindata='[null,null,"bind(&#39;java/com/google/gws/plugins/horizon/jobs/viewer/herocontent/jslayout/feedback_messages.html#JobAtEmployer&#39;,{employer_name:&#39;Segula Technologies&#39;,job_title:&#39;Data Analysis_CVVS_ Inhouse&#39;})","_2tL6at-hKI3BjuMPgsuI8QY_235",null,13,null,null,null,null,null,5025273,"horizon_jobs",[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,