rgent leadership requests by collecting, analyzing,\r\n     and summarizing technical information across VSS, VEPE, and engineering\r\n     organizations.\u003c/li\u003e\r\n \u003cli\u003eMaintain and analyze key CVSS data including annual trip plans,\r\n     validation activities, benchmarking plans, resource utilization, and\r\n     program metrics. \u003c/li\u003e\r\n \u003cli\u003eDevelop dashboards, reports, executive summaries, and\r\n     presentation materials for leadership reviews. \u003c/li\u003e\r\n \u003cli\u003eConsolidate information from multiple organizations into a\r\n     single source of truth to support planning, issue resolution, and\r\n     decision-making.\u003c/li\u003e\r\n \u003cli\u003eSupport continuous improvement initiatives by identifying\r\n     trends, risks, gaps, and opportunities across programs. \u003c/li\u003e\r\n\u003c/ul\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cb\u003eQualifications\u003c/b\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cul\u003e\r\n \u003cli\u003eBachelor's degree in Engineering, Data Analytics, or related\r\n     field.\u003c/li\u003e\r\n \u003cli\u003eStrong analytical, problem-solving, and organizational skills.\u003c/li\u003e\r\n \u003cli\u003eProficiency in Excel, Power BI, PowerPoint, and data\r\n     visualization tools.\u003c/li\u003e\r\n \u003cli\u003eAbility to summarize complex technical information for\r\n     leadership audiences.\u003c/li\u003e\r\n \u003cli\u003eExperience with automotive product development, validation,\r\n     benchmarking, or vehicle engineering preferred.\u003c/li\u003e\r\n\u003c/ul\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cb\u003eSuccess Measures\u003c/b\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cul\u003e\r\n \u003cli\u003eReduced response time to technical information requests.\u003c/li\u003e\r\n \u003cli\u003eImproved visibility of benchmarking and vehicle synthesis\r\n     activities.\u003c/li\u003e\r\n \u003cli\u003eAccurate and timely reporting of VSS plans, metrics, and\r\n     program status.\u003c/li\u003e\r\