s responsible for data analysis and root cause analysis. You will be part of the Ethoca Data Science team that is working on interesting challenges which will directly impact the product.Responsibilities Include Conduct data analysis Perform root cause analysis, problem solving and finding anomalies in the data Join large data sets, searching data, and aggregating data Manual validation and data annotation Create KPIs and metrics for reporting and to maintain a pulse of the system Build creative ways of automating the processes Support senior data scientist in data qualityAn Ideal Candidate Will Have Solid experience in SQL – able to work on multiple different SQL environments Prior experience in joining large data sets, searching data, and aggregating data Should be able to quickly re-prioritize Background in data quality Ability to work independently Communicate results to team members and stakeholders Prior experience with reporting tools is nice to have Previous experience in Python is nice to haveSkills And Qualifications SQL, Python, Microsoft Excel Bachelor’s degree in STEM field is required Experience in Azure is a plusCorporate Security Responsibility All activities involving access to Mastercard assets, information, and networks comes with an inherent risk to the organization and, therefore, it is expected that every person working for, or on behalf of, Mastercard is responsible for information security and must:Abide by Mastercard’s security policies and practices;Ensure the confidentiality and integrity of the information being accessed;Report any suspected information security violation or breach, andComplete all periodic mandatory security trainings in accordance with Mastercard’s guidelines.","Sr. Data Analyst - SCI0202",null,null,0,[["organization","Mastercard"],["organization_mid","/m/021b7r"],["publisher_name","Jobaaj"],["location_feature_id","/google/oyster/feature/0x3bc2bf2e67461101:0x828d43bf9d9ee343"],["cluster_id","0x033b7b0dc324f762"]],0],[nu